      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "%@ %@" : {
      "comment" : "A checkmark icon followed by a title and description of a specific app permission. The title and description are generated from the `overviewTitle` and `overviewDescription` functions, respectively. The argument is the string “앱 사용 제한”, the string “위치 접근 · 항상”, the string “정확한 위치”, or the string “Background App Refresh”.",
