          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ %@ %@ %@ %@" : {
      "comment" : "A clock face with a start time and end time. The first argument is the start time. The second argument is the start time period (AM/PM). The third argument is the end time. The fourth argument is the end time period (AM/PM).",
